              "name": "Noeller67"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Yummy salad! I used yogurt in place of the sour cream to make a healthier salad. Substituted craisins and almonds for the raisins and pecans. A nice refreshing salad!"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
