            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Renea Dodson"
            },
            "reviewBody": "great recipe..I used cranberries instead of raisins, Greek yogurt instead of sour cream. a little vanilla and sprinkle of cinnamon. will definitely be making again.thank you.",
