            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "TishieKate"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made this for my kids as they don't care for coleslaw or potato salad. My husband said it was his favorite out of the three! I halved the recipe and used walnuts instead of \npecans and half granny smith, half yellow delicious apples. Very refreshing.",
            "datePublished": "2006-07-02T08:52:40.140Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
