            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Sara"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was what it says! Delicious! I would use it more as a dessert than with dinner. I used sliced almonds instead of the pecans and everyone loved it! Only thing prep time took a lot longer to peel the apples so not sure would make it again so quick!!",
            "datePublished": "2011-02-04T14:30:56.590Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Ellie Mae"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was refreshing. I used honey crisp apples because we LOVE these apples. I also used walnuts and added a little extra sugar and light cinnamon,and 1/2 raisins and dried cranberries. My husband said this is a keeper! I won't go back to my Mom's old apple salad recipe. Thanks!",
            "datePublished": "2007-10-24T09:16:04.360Z"
          },
          {
