            },
            "reviewBody": "I added more sugar (about 1/4 cup - 1/2 cup) to the recipe as well as some cinnamon to taste. We prefer a slightly sweeter apple salad.",
            "datePublished": "2003-10-29T21:08:45.363Z"
          },
