            },
            "reviewBody": "This is best to let set in refrigerator overnight or at least a few hours before serving. I used dried cranberries instead of the raisins and chopped walnuts in place of the pecans.\n\nThank you for this great refreshing salad recipe. Will definitely be making it again.",
            "datePublished": "2007-05-27T09:08:45.740Z"
          },
