            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Sara"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was decent. But, it made a LOT - and didn't keep well. The raisins really bloat overnight and do not taste good the second day. I also thought it needed more sugar than called for - so I increased it to 1/4 cup. Overall, I thought it was fairly good the first day, but I have made other apple salads that I like better.",
            "datePublished": "2008-02-10T18:51:28.127Z"
